Description:
    Creates a SnFoil::Deserializer Scaffold

Arguments:
    model: *required* The name of the model

Options:
    path: The path the files will be created at. default: app/deserializers
    type: The type of deserializer to create (json, jsonapi). default: json

Example:
    rails generate snfoil:deserializer User

    This will create:
        app/deserializers/user_deserializer.rb